+The files hold the count. A round leaves one of these marks in the log of the branch:
+
+- A failed review: a commit "Review tests CH-xxxx" or "Review acceptance IN-xxxx" with
+  `Result: fail`.
+- A commit "Send back CH-xxxx: <stage>".
